flowchart TD
    A[Browse Shop] --> B[View Product]
    B --> C[Add to Cart]
    C --> D{Cart has items?}
    D -- No --> A
    D -- Yes --> E[Enter Checkout Details]
    E --> F{Form valid?}
    F -- No --> E
    F -- Yes --> G[Save Demo Order in localStorage]
    G --> H[Clear Cart]
    H --> I[Order Confirmation]
